      ["Polar to rectangular","x=r\\cos\\theta,\\quad y=r\\sin\\theta"],
      ["Rectangular to polar","r^2=x^2+y^2,\\quad \\tan\\theta=\\frac yx"],
      ["Polar distance","d=\\sqrt{r_1^2+r_2^2-2r_1r_2\\cos(\\theta_2-\\theta_1)}"]
    ]},
    {"title":"Conics + parametric functions","items":[
      ["Circle","(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2=r^2"],
      ["Ellipse","\\frac{(x-h)^2}{a^2}+\\frac{(y-k)^2}{b^2}=1"],
      ["Hyperbola","\\frac{(x-h)^2}{a^2}-\\frac{(y-k)^2}{b^2}=1"],
      ["Parabola","(x-h)^2=4p(y-k)"],
      ["Parametric circle","x=h+r\\cos t,\\quad y=k+r\\sin t"]
